            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "el chefe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used green thai chilies instead of jalapeños.\nI garnished with a whole red thail chili in each glass, which looked rad.\nNot too spicy, but has a great kick. \nI'll make it again!",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-11T02:45:38.960Z"
